ID  - 42941552
TI  - Urinary Stone Recurrence After Initiation of GLP-1-Based Therapy: A Romanian Retrospective Cohort Study of Clinical, Renal, and Hydration-Related Factors.
AU  - Danau Razvan Alexandru
AU  - Munteanu Madalina Andreea
AU  - Mitel Andrei
AU  - Predoiu Gabriel
AU  - Secareanu Ileana
